# Voice AI Agent (FastAPI)

Boilerplate async FastAPI service for a real-time voice AI agent.

## Run

```bash
python3.11 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

## Endpoints

- `GET /health`
- `GET /metrics`
- `WS /ws/talk`

## WebSocket Messages (`/ws/talk`)

Audio chunk:

```json
{
  "type": "audio_chunk",
  "format": "pcm16",
  "sample_rate": 16000,
  "data": "<base64>"
}
```

Control message:

```json
{
  "type": "control",
  "action": "ping",
  "payload": {}
}
```

## Microphone Streaming Simulator Client

Run:

```bash
python3 ws_mic_client.py --url ws://localhost:8000/ws/talk
```

Optional audio playback dependency:

```bash
pip install simpleaudio
```
